had a single production of anything. But based on that,

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:12.400
my agent felt encouraged enough to send it out

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:16.100
to Hollywood just as a writing sample in the

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.800
hopes that I might get some meetings and maybe get like

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:23.400
a staffing job on a TV show or something, but somehow in

