the way that these things happen in their magical way,

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.800
it ended up at a junior executive desk at Warner Brothers,

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:33.700
who read it, and he's about my age, you He only gave it to his

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:38.400
boss, a guy named Kevin McCormick who was an executive

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:43.800
at Warner Bros for many years and a brilliant guy and he

